Subject: BleedEffect: Replace BukkitRunnable timer with entity scheduler runAtFixedRate

AE PATCH REASON: Anonymous BukkitRunnable + runTaskTimer is incompatible with Folia region-threaded architecture and crashes at runtime (UnsupportedOperationException); a per-entity repeating task must run on the entity's own region thread.
AE PATCH FIX: Replace anonymous BukkitRunnable + runTaskTimer with var2.getScheduler().runAtFixedRate (EntityScheduler, retired=null). Convert mutable anonymous-class fields loop/lastDeath to local finals (loop via int[1] array) and replace this.cancel() with task.cancel(). Swap BukkitRunnable import for ScheduledTask/Consumer imports.
AE PATCH RISK: LOW - MIGRATE: BukkitRunnable → EntityScheduler runAtFixedRate. No behavior change.

